nd him on  another path and it kind of keeps this  journey going which of course Marvel  will continue doing likely in the pages  of Thor but it is fun and in fact it  actually does continue in Thor number 29  but it is fun and it is really really  cool so thank you all for watching and I  will catch you all later  peace  [Music]
 

